  "description": "This package contains Silk.NET's high-level, cross-platform human input abstractions. \n            A net10.0-only fork of Silk.NET, providing bindings to OpenGL, OpenAL, Vulkan, GLFW, and SDL. Trimming- and NativeAOT-ready. Not compatible with upstream Silk.NET.",
  "iconFile": "silkdotnet_v3.png",
